### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://192.168.1.72:8000/api
@id=048bde6e-371b-464c-a4e0-ea920f2389fa

---

### 1. INSCRIPTION (Registration)

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "motdepasse123",
  "password2": "motdepasse123",
  "first_name": "Jean",
  "last_name": "Dupont"
}


####
GET https://dodome-backend.onrender.com/api/public/b/bleulight-event-3e88f4/items/048bde6e-371b-464c-a4e0-ea920f2389fa/recommendations/?type=complementary

---

### 2. CONNEXION (Login)

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

---

### 3. CONNEXION GOOGLE (Google Auth)

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_FROM_MOBILE_APP"
}

---

### 4. SESSION ACTUELLE (Me) — inclut le `slug` du business

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

### 5. CRÉER UN BUSINESS

POST {{baseUrl}}/businesses/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Mon Entreprise",
  "business_type": "LOCATION_VEHICULES",
  "adresse": "123 Rue de la Paix, 75001 Paris",
  "telephone": "+33123456789",
  "email": "contact@monentreprise.com"
}

---

### 6. LIEN PUBLIC VITRINE (Client) — à partager

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/

# Exemple avec slug réel:
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/bluelight-even-5894c5/

---

### 7. CATALOGUE PUBLIC (Articles)

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/items/

---

### 8. DISPONIBILITÉ ARTICLE (Public)

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/items/{{item_id}}/availability/?date_debut=2026-09-01&date_fin=2026-09-05

---

### 9. CRÉER DEMANDE RÉSERVATION (Public)

POST {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/booking-requests/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_id": "ITEM_UUID",
  "date_debut": "2026-09-01",
  "date_fin": "2026-09-05",
  "quantite": 1,
  "client_nom": "Client Test",
  "client_email": "client@test.com",
  "client_telephone": "+33612345678",
  "motif": "Weekend"
}

---

### 10. SUIVI DEMANDE PAR TOKEN (Public, sans slug)

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/booking-requests/{{token}}/

---

### 11. LISTE RÉSERVATIONS (Team)

GET {{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{business_id}}/reservations/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

### 12. CRÉER FACTURE (Team)

POST {{baseUrl}}/businesses/{{business_id}}/invoices/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservation_id": "RESERVATION_UUID",
  "type": "PROFORMA",
  "tva_taux": "20.00"
}

---

### 13. FACTURE PUBLIQUE (Client)

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/invoices/{{reservation_id}}/

---

### 14. PDF FACTURE PUBLIQUE

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/b/{{slug}}/invoices/{{reservation_id}}/pdf/

---

### Variables à remplacer
@token = VOTRE_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI
@business_id = UUID_DU_BUSINESS
@slug = SLUG_DU_BUSINESS (ex: bluelight-even-5894c5)
@item_id = UUID_DE_L_ARTICLE
@reservation_id = UUID_DE_LA_RESERVATION
@token = TOKEN_DE_LA_DEMANDE